  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major></Major>
    <Description>Made for Apex Legend Light jitter aim to reduce horizontal recoil //only need to track or pull down

Resolution used when making the script: 1366 x 768  //can also be used in any resolution 
Sensitivity: 1.78 ingame and 1000dpi on mouse software 

Hotkey to ON/OFF are recommended if binded on Mouse1 </Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download </Comment>
